      "path": "src/ui/screens/OwedDebtItem.tsx",
      "content": "If getDefinitions rejects (for example, on a persistence read failure), open() exits without calling onClose, and the void event handler leaves an unhandled rejection. The other debts remain disabled even though no form or Cancel control has appeared. Catch loading failures, release the active-debt lock, and display a recoverable error; also give feedback for NotFound rather than silently closing.",
